  "note": "PreenFM2 is 4-timbre multitimbral (channels 1-4). Presets: Bank Select CC 0 (2 = DX7 banks 0-127; 3 = DX7 banks 128-255) then CC 32 (bank number), then Program Change; per midi.guide. CC labels follow midi.guide."
